  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Mine act. 2006-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF minhant. 2006-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet fokuseras p&#xe5; kapacitetsutveckling till nationella akt&#xf6;rer och st&#xf6;d till utveckling och implementering av riskreduceringsprogram g&#xe4;llande SALW och minor, s&#xe5;som informationskampanjer,  riskutbildningsprojekt, integrering av riskutbildning i skolplaner, nationell integrering av riskutbildning och &quot;victim assistance&quot; i andra sektorer s&#xe5;som h&#xe4;lsa, social service, utbildning m.m.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is focused on capacity development of national actors and support to the development and implementation of risk reduction programmes for SALW and mines, such as information campaigns, risk education projects, integration of risk eduction in school, national integration of risk education and victim assistance in other sectors such as health, social services and education, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
